Package: dahlia-storage
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Dahlia Linux <https://github.com/Fabiy99/dahlia-linux>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), util-linux, fdisk, e2fsprogs, xfsprogs, btrfs-progs, mergerfs, fuse3, rsync, exfatprogs, cryptsetup-bin, systemd-cryptsetup
Recommends: snapraid, smartmontools, hdparm
Description: Dahlia Linux storage management
 dahlia-disk detects existing disks and mounts them without formatting,
 generates systemd mount units, keeps the mergerfs pools /mnt/storage and
 /mnt/user in sync at runtime and writes the SnapRAID configuration.
